{"created": "2025-02-28T08:50:54.905058+00:00", "modified": "2025-02-28T08:50:55.131466+00:00", "id": 14936551, "conceptrecid": "14936550", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.14936551", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.14936550", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14936551", "metadata": {"title": "Synthetic district heating meter data", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.14936551", "publication_date": "2025-02-27", "description": "<p>Synthetic utility meter data in four different versions</p>\n<p>case1: No uncertainty in the data, all insulation levels and consumptions are equal. Constant temperature at the entrance of the main pipe</p>\n<p>case4: Noisy data, uncertainties on position of service pipe lengths and positions, fluctuating temperature at entrance of the main pipe</p>\n<p>case2-3: in between.</p>\n<p>SoilTemp.mat contains the soil temperature from DMI.dk</p>\n<p>relevante adresser contains x-location of the service pipes and lenght of service pipe</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span></span><span></span></p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "\u00d8stergaard, Peter", "affiliation": "Danish Technological Institute", "orcid": "0000-0002-7211-7190"}], "version": "1.0", "language": "dan", "custom": {"code:programmingLanguage": [{"id": "matlab", "title": {"en": "MATLAB"}}], "code:developmentStatus": {"id": "active", "title": {"en": "Active"}}}, "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "meeting": {"title": "CIM 2025", "dates": "11-14 March 2025", "place": "Lyon, France", "url": "https://www.cim-metrology.org/en/", "session": "S18"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "grants": [{"code": "22DIT02", "internal_id": "10.13039/501100000780::22DIT02", "funder": {"name": "European Commission", "doi": "10.13039/501100000780", "acronym": "EC"}, "title": "FunSNM", "url": "https://www.metpart.eu/"}], "communities": [{"id": "funsnm"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "14936550"}}]}, "notes": "<p><span><s